<title>USA: Old Republic retired exec Stover dies.</title>
<headline>Old Republic retired exec Stover dies.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Old Republic International Corp said Tuesday that William Stover, its retired chairman and chief executive officer, died August 30 after a long illness.</p>
<p>He was 73.</p>
<p>Mr. Stover retired on December 31, 1992 but continued as chairman of the executive committee and as a director of the company.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
